==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|Yellow}} tells {{adv|Red}} the rest of {{adv|Deoxys|Organism No. 2}}'s history. {{tt|*|was included in the previous volume in the VIZ release}}
* {{adv|Blue}} helps {{adv|Silver}} acknowledge that {{adv|Giovanni}} is his father. {{tt|*|was included in the previous volume in the VIZ release}}
* Red gives Yellow his old [[Pokédex]]. {{tt|*|was included in the previous volume in the VIZ release}}
* Organism No. 2 goes off to find Organism No. 1. [[Sird]] tries to capture it. {{tt|*|was included in the previous volume in the VIZ release}}
* Red, Blue, {{adv|Green}}, Yellow, and Silver are turned to stone. {{tt|*|was included in the previous volume in the VIZ release}}
* The building of the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|III}} in [[Hoenn]] is completed.
* {{adv|Emerald}} arrives at the Battle Frontier and meets [[Todd Snap]].
* Emerald crashes the opening ceremonies.
* The [[Frontier Brain]]s set up a challenge for Emerald; he has to defeat all seven facilities in seven days.
* Emerald reveals that he is not at the Battle Frontier only to challenge the facilities.
* {{adv|Crystal}} is revealed to be helping Emerald.

